:''For the harder version, see [[Speed Cat (Veteran)|Tuesday Blitz Stage]].''
The '''Tuesday Stage''' (火曜ステージ, ''Kayō Sutēji'', '''Tuesday Stage''') contains three levels, each with a chance to drop a [[Speed Up]] when completed. It was added in [[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.3 Update|Version 2.0.3]].

